[{"title":"奉呈何叔信魏昭甫三首 其三","author":"赵蕃","text":"春风大属野樱朱，树树相望绮不如。\n却忆山家篱堑畔，十分春日付谁渠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47614,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉呈何叔信魏昭甫三首 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"梅花寂寞已飞仙，一夜春催杏欲然。\n老眼看花愁欲眩，却怜草色静芊芊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47615,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉呈何叔信魏昭甫三首 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"寒厅寂寞不知春，登眺招要藉所亲。\n始谓姑倾一杯酒，已焉颠倒白纶巾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47616,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉寄斯远兼属文鼎处州子永提属五首 其五","author":"赵蕃","text":"闻道当年五色裘，飘然又入帝王州。\n烦君一为问行李，早晚遣诗相报投。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47617,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉寄斯远兼属文鼎处州子永提属五首 其四","author":"赵蕃","text":"几向馀干觅介庵，骑鲸已去不容骖。\n流风付与南池主，何日约君相就谈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47618,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉寄斯远兼属文鼎处州子永提属五首 其三","author":"赵蕃","text":"两贤堂下竹参天，雨后涓涓陆子泉。\n耆书难忘是曾吕，逸遗更取孟郊篇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47619,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉寄斯远兼属文鼎处州子永提属五首 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"水南佳处说吾州，塔庙相高竹树幽。\n落尽梅花雨方暗，垫巾无藉一来游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47620,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉寄斯远兼属文鼎处州子永提属五首 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"吟诗日日数梅花，梅向飘零我返家。\n尚有北枝堪点检，君舟已泊岸头沙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47621,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉简在伯四首 其四","author":"赵蕃","text":"落日馀霞已自奇，况于人静月明时。\n重城著我非无意，前遣先生独赋诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47622,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉简在伯四首 其三","author":"赵蕃","text":"书中旧学来禽帖，今日蛮州得饫尝。\n要与先生共咀嚼，更将煮蜜助甘香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47623,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉简在伯四首 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"先生自合饮官壶，野老端宜满眼酤。\n白酒酿成聊送汝，未知湿沫与江湖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47624,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉简在伯四首 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"渊明种秫有公田，郑老时时得酒钱。\n笑我作官浑乏此，自炊斗酒慰馋涎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47625,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉简钦止兼忆斯远 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"前日丛篁苦蔽溪，祇今檐与四山齐。\n裴回有句不能吐，要与乘凉一杖藜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47626,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉简钦止兼忆斯远 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"阿连闻说有归期，准拟俱来赋此诗。\n已是欲行还小住，纵令频合故伤离。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47627,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"姑苏道中","author":"赵蕃","text":"麦浪摇波柳映津，吴乡春色见今晨。\n欲将何以慰无赖，一酌浊醪如有神。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47628,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"季永和诗索酒用韵送酒二首 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"我贫无酒为君欢，渴梦相从碾凤团。\n薄暮白衣才有馈，试令分减愧酸寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47629,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"季永和诗索酒用韵送酒二首 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"珍重平生书五车，不妨有子更持家。\n小閒便欲巾车去，只欲论文非看花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47630,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"孤雁三首 其三","author":"赵蕃","text":"孤雁哀哀叫晚洲，水长山远政悠悠。\n凶年未必稻粱足，巧中更防罹缴忧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47631,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"孤雁三首 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"孤雁哀哀叫晚云，半年为客叹离群。\n丁东幽佩别来久，断续清砧远不闻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47632,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"孤雁三首 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"孤雁哀哀叫晓霜，客衾如水待天光。\n不缘杜宇催归去，未信寒猿解断肠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47633,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宜春道中赠邢公昭二首 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"问君家在离骚国，句里应含兰芷香。\n邂逅宜春须小住，要期倾倒锦为囊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47634,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宜春道中赠邢公昭二首 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"清江台上读君诗，颇欲相从慰所思。\n何意昌山夜止宿，忽成风雨对床期。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47635,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宝气亭三首 其三","author":"赵蕃","text":"徐家笔力见南唐，今代更推江夏黄。\n屹立二碑端不朽，未输滕阁擅三王。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47636,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宝气亭三首 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"谁道剑池今已荒，有时光怪此何祥。\n平生自省惭多识，曷日乞灵亲炷香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47637,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宝气亭三首 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"西下扁舟浩所经，暂梯堤石上津亭。\n偶从长老询遗迹，说道神游尚炳灵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47638,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"实相书院","author":"赵蕃","text":"已矣骑鲸去不回，怅然犹咏早归来。\n空馀旧日读书地，水绕山围似钓台。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47639,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"帖永新韩主簿","author":"赵蕃","text":"韩君惠我涪翁帖，三世风流不在兹。\n诸老当年会临汝，更须多有未传诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47640,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"帖俞王诸君求笔","author":"赵蕃","text":"颜公笔法有家法，豪锥料得皆千金。\n闻道分张遍亲友，可能乞我助呻吟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47641,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"帖耆英","author":"赵蕃","text":"朝来霰雪遽如许，忍冻髯曾应屡哦。\n急送饼芽并致炭，助君灰里拨阴何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47642,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"往时","author":"赵蕃","text":"往时听说严州水，试向经行觅旧痕。\n尚有浮槎栖古木，可怜万壑势并吞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47643,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"招仲威不至反辱惠梨","author":"赵蕃","text":"屡废招呼定可人，岂嫌昏暮叩门频。\n不来醉我倾家酿，反更分渠饤坐珍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47644,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"招在伯","author":"赵蕃","text":"忽忽重阳今一月，菊花数朵见城根。\n前诗有约能从否，不厌张罗幸过门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47645,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"孙子进惠笔乃周寿玉簪样试用其一已作秃翁犹耐驱使成绝句二首异日当寄子进昆仲 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"遂初赋就笔馀铓，赠我蒙探古锦囊。\n耐久固殊流俗败，含情浑似故人长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47646,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"松原山行七绝 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"雨势崩腾略未休，涧冲溪恶使人愁。\n那知今日松原路，拄杖挑包得自由。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47647,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"松原山行七绝 其七","author":"赵蕃","text":"一日周遭度九溪，快侬双脚净无泥。\n真同落落石为枕，宁愧区区沙筑堤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47648,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"松原山行七绝 其四","author":"赵蕃","text":"雨后浮云更拥山，须臾已作太空还。\n了然悟得渊明意，投绂归来径掩关。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47649,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"松原山行七绝 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"莫道松原路不通，担肩樵斧往来同。\n老夫自是山中友，要涉崎岖尽日中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47650,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"松原山行七绝 其三","author":"赵蕃","text":"乌噪猿号古树丛，乱青参倚更撑空。\n悠然到处皆诗本，须信山行不负公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47651,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"松原山行七绝 其六","author":"赵蕃","text":"涉水穿云殊好在，自知元是个中人。\n何时粗毕尚平志，衡岳匡庐收此身。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47652,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"松原山行七绝 其五","author":"赵蕃","text":"电激雷奔是处闻，绿周青绕四无分。\n哦诗几侧风前帽，纵目閒看雨后云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47653,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"枕上","author":"赵蕃","text":"道人急打五更钟，窗外悲风正吼松。\n归梦不须惊久客，骤寒便欲作初冬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47654,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"林湘乡出其先人诗卷题其后二首 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"松陵我亦屡曾经，几欲张帆过洞庭。\n愿借此诗传善本，教儿诵读醉时听。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47655,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"林湘乡出其先人诗卷题其后二首 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"知公苦急簿书仍，留我閒窗语夜灯。\n更出此诗令细读，今宵有梦到松陵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47656,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"泊舟西村见居民云数里间有梅访之殊未花","author":"赵蕃","text":"漠漠烟村四五家，水清霜落路平沙。\n我来欲问梅消息，地冷年年未放花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47657,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"知府提举访求前守凌公遗迹忽于庭庑雨压复壁中得公所题诗赋六绝句 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"辰人只识凌刑部，不识尚书晚岁官。\n晚岁功名益堪纪，辰人不识坐荒寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47658,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"知府提举访求前守凌公遗迹忽于庭庑雨压复壁中得公所题诗赋六绝句 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"使君剖竹继先贤，四十于今又六年。\n每恨无从考遗事，但凭亭槛览山川。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47659,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"知府提举访求前守凌公遗迹忽于庭庑雨压复壁中得公所题诗赋六绝句 其五","author":"赵蕃","text":"檐浅终防剥蚀灾，好移深奥示将来。\n更须刻石行于世，公道只今方大开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47660,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"知府提举访求前守凌公遗迹忽于庭庑雨压复壁中得公所题诗赋六绝句 其四","author":"赵蕃","text":"故相曾兴告讦风，一时多坐语言中。\n乃知复壁遮防意，是谓知公亦爱公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47661,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"知府提举访求前守凌公遗迹忽于庭庑雨压复壁中得公所题诗赋六绝句 其六","author":"赵蕃","text":"郡斋新刻总珍藏，得此遗踪益有光。\n再拜从公乞馀本，归赍不复恨空囊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47662,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月八日发潭州后得绝句四十首 其四十","author":"赵蕃","text":"终朝未厌哭滩声，归近何妨细作程。\n送尽鹅湖青一带，灵山已复远相迎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47663,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"经旬不作诗今日霜晴可喜问梅沈园得两绝句此坡所谓痼疾逢虾蟹也 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"自从篱菊报香衰，便说南枝与北枝。\n底事频来问消息，山翁近日绝无诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47664,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"经旬不作诗今日霜晴可喜问梅沈园得两绝句此坡所谓痼疾逢虾蟹也 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"莫问今年与去年，祇应贫病两依然。\n故人满眼今谁在，且赋梅花第一篇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47665,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"经孺子亭观龙井","author":"赵蕃","text":"寒泉百尺几秋春，祠祷流传信若神。\n何事古先殊昧此，为霖顾取筑岩人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47666,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"范参政自建康得资政宫祠六诗寄呈 其六","author":"赵蕃","text":"我梦石湖堂上书，烟云鸥鸟不关渠。\n奥篇隐帙诚难了，辞愿一鸱开锁鱼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47667,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"范参政自建康得资政宫祠六诗寄呈 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"闻道石湖天下奇，城南未数阆州稀。\n江山胜处世或有，祗欠若人相发挥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47668,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"范参政自建康得资政宫祠六诗寄呈 其三","author":"赵蕃","text":"出处如公亦甚都，不携西子不思鲈。\n三高异日当为四，不见方严与范俱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47669,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"范参政自建康得资政宫祠六诗寄呈 其四","author":"赵蕃","text":"一再将书托置邮，渺然殊未亦湛浮。\n平生愿识才能见，别去于今岁又周。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47670,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"范参政自建康得资政宫祠六诗寄呈 其五","author":"赵蕃","text":"风月沧浪自逐臣，烟波甫里亦遗民。\n未闻官号大学士，辞逊雍容得退身。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47671,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"范参政自建康得资政宫祠六诗寄呈 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"细思不是乞身难，政为贫贤不放閒。\n奏疏比闻频叩阙，诏恩今见许还山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47672,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"诗一首","author":"赵蕃","text":"学语浑似学参禅，要保心传与耳传。\n秋菊春兰宁易地，清风明月本同天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47673,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郊居晚行呈章令四首 其四","author":"赵蕃","text":"渊明薪水忧儿子，玉川送米烦邻僧。\n我今穷状不可道，减忧得米忧年登。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47674,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郊居晚行呈章令四首 其三","author":"赵蕃","text":"人言乐岁好催科，吾今方知自拊摩。\n要识田家略无事，杀鸡为黍自相过。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47675,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郊居晚行呈章令四首 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"早禾打谷归高廪，槁秸堆场尚若云。\n目见田庐无此比，劝耕知自令君勤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47676,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郊居晚行呈章令四首 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"斜阳渺渺下前陂，牛自安眠儿得嬉。\n行过中林却回顾，眼边依约有新诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47677,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郑仲理送行六首 其六","author":"赵蕃","text":"病著形骸冷更慵，短檠宁复有新工。\n异时邂逅相逢处，应叹依然旧阿蒙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47678,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郑仲理送行六首 其五","author":"赵蕃","text":"渺然一棹去何之，满目新诗与旧诗。\n细读赠章多好语，顾怜追和却无奇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47679,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郑仲理送行六首 其四","author":"赵蕃","text":"溪山廓廓眼增明，鸥鹭依依旧有盟。\n所恨登高临赋处，却嗟我友不同行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47680,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郑仲理送行六首 其三","author":"赵蕃","text":"坐上每怀歌慷慨，杯行岂复计寻常。\n我知不隔清风面，君想未忘明月章。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47681,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郑仲理送行六首 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"几度拿舟湘水西，风雩亭下咏而归。\n驩然诸友相忘意，不叩仙坛与佛扉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47682,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郑仲理送行六首 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"周郎三复似南容，君亦因之师友同。\n岂待湖南始相识，闻风元自大江东。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47683,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金凤花","author":"赵蕃","text":"既知梧留凤，宁令凤在笯。\n胡为五色羽，散作一庭花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47684,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"钓矶 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"乐是烟波好，宁须竿线劳。\n功高殊钓渭，意适似游濠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47685,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨中","author":"赵蕃","text":"四月梅黄雨易成，夜来犹是十分晴。\n吴山越岭浑遮尽，惟见江流面面平。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47686,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨中同曹尉王儦岩二首 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"骤雨翻空何自来，飞流溅沫洗崔嵬。\n要题短句书奇事，付与曹郎八斗才。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47687,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨中同曹尉王儦岩二首 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"旧说吾邦岩谷多，历观无愈此嵯峨。\n今朝唤渡仍冲雨，惭愧溪神不我诃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47688,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨中夜归闻两儿诵书偶成二绝幸明叔先生同赋以示之 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"檐雨浪浪欲二更，短檠明火读书声。\n忆如汝大政如汝，一事无成今老生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47689,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]